    "html": "<section class=\"lens-view lens-dispatch-view\"><h3>similar-locations-validate · 3×1×1 workgroups × 64×1×1 lanes = 192 invocations</h3><svg class=\"lens-workgroups\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 24\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Workgroups\"><defs><pattern id=\"lens-gpu-spatial-analysis-similar-locations-kernel-hatched\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#595959\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line></pattern></defs><rect x=\"1\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#181818\" stroke-width=\"3\" data-state=\"selection\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"0\"></rect><rect x=\"21\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"41\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"2\"></rect></svg><h4>Workgroup 0 (default)</h4><svg class=\"lens-lanes\" viewBox=\"0 0 1280 64\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Lanes in expanded workgroup\"><defs><pattern id=\"lens-gpu-spatial-analysis-similar-locations-kernel-lanes-hatched\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#595959\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line></pattern></defs><image width=\"1280\" height=\"64\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" image-rendering=\"pixelated\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" data-raster-width=\"32\" data-raster-height=\"2\" data-sampling=\"nearest\" href=\"data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAACAAAAACCAMAAAAOwC77AAAAA1BMVEVfZnJNNohmAAAATUlEQVR4AQFCAL3/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEIAAb1u9mUAAAAASUVORK5CYII=\"></image><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"0\"><text x=\"5\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">0</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"1\"><text x=\"45\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">1</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"2\"><text x=\"85\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">2</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"3\"><text x=\"125\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">3</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"4\"><text x=\"165\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">4</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"5\"><text x=\"205\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">5</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"6\"><text x=\"245\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">6</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"7\"><text x=\"285\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">7</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"8\"><text x=\"325\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">8</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"9\"><text x=\"365\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">9</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"10\"><text x=\"405\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">10</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"11\"><text x=\"445\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">11</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"12\"><text x=\"485\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">12</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"13\"><text x=\"525\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">13</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"14\"><text x=\"565\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">14</text></g></svg><p>64 lanes; first 15 and pinned lane labelled. Grey cells are idle or unavailable.</p><p>id probe not recorded; lane ids are computed from the dispatch shape · apple</p><figure class=\"lens-kernel-source\"><pre><code data-language=\"wgsl\"><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"1\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"2\">override INVOCATION_COUNT: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"3\">override WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_X: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"4\">override WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_Y: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"5\">const attributesOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"6\">@group(0) @binding(0) var&lt;storage, read&gt; attributes: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"7\">const validityOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"8\">@group(0) @binding(1) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; validity: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"9\">const ROW_COUNT: u32 = 136u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"10\">const ATTRIBUTE_COUNT: u32 = 5u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"11\">const MAX_RESULTS: u32 = 32u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"12\">const NO_RANK: u32 = 0xffffffffu;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"13\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"14\">fn isFiniteValue(value: f32) -&gt; bool { return (bitcast&lt;u32&gt;(value) &amp; 0x7f800000u) != 0x7f800000u; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"15\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"16\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"17\">// WGSL rejects NaN constants, so build one from a runtime bit pattern.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"18\">fn getNaN() -&gt; f32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"19\">  var bits = 0x7fc00000u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"20\">  return bitcast&lt;f32&gt;(bits);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"21\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"22\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"23\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"24\">fn getRoundedDifference(minuend: f32, subtrahend: f32, runtimeZero: u32) -&gt; f32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"25\">  return bitcast&lt;f32&gt;(bitcast&lt;u32&gt;(minuend - subtrahend) ^ runtimeZero);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"26\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"27\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"28\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"29\">fn getAdditionRoundingError(first: f32, second: f32, sum: f32) -&gt; f32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"30\">  let firstBits = bitcast&lt;u32&gt;(first);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"31\">  let secondBits = bitcast&lt;u32&gt;(second);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"32\">  let sumBits = bitcast&lt;u32&gt;(sum);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"33\">  let firstMagnitude = firstBits &amp; 0x7fffffffu;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"34\">  let secondMagnitude = secondBits &amp; 0x7fffffffu;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"35\">  let sumMagnitude = sumBits &amp; 0x7fffffffu;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"36\">  // A zero operand makes the addition exact; an infinity or a NaN has no rounding error to report.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"37\">  if (firstMagnitude == 0u || secondMagnitude == 0u ||\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"38\">      max(max(firstMagnitude, secondMagnitude), sumMagnitude) &gt;= 0x7f800000u) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"39\">    return 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"40\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"41\">  let firstIsLarger = firstMagnitude &gt;= secondMagnitude;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"42\">  let largerBits = select(secondBits, firstBits, firstIsLarger);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"43\">  let smallerBits = select(firstBits, secondBits, firstIsLarger);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"44\">  let largerMagnitude = largerBits &amp; 0x7fffffffu;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"45\">  let smallerMagnitude = smallerBits &amp; 0x7fffffffu;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"46\">  // Biased exponents (1 for subnormals) and 24-bit significands: |value| = significand * 2^(exponent - 150).\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"47\">  let largerExponent = max(largerMagnitude &gt;&gt; 23u, 1u);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"48\">  let smallerExponent = max(smallerMagnitude &gt;&gt; 23u, 1u);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"49\">  let sumExponent = max(sumMagnitude &gt;&gt; 23u, 1u);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"50\">  // Below 2^-103 the error would be subnormal, where ldexp is not dependable: report none.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"51\">  if (smallerExponent &lt; 24u) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"52\">    return 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"53\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"54\">  let gap = largerExponent - smallerExponent;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"55\">  if (gap &gt; 25u) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"56\">    // The smaller operand is below a quarter of the larger one&#39;s last place: the sum is the larger\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"57\">    // operand and the whole smaller operand is the error.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"58\">    if (sumBits == largerBits) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"59\">      return bitcast&lt;f32&gt;(smallerBits);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"60\">    }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"61\">    return 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"62\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"63\">  // The sum&#39;s last place, as a left shift from the smaller operand&#39;s last place. A rounded sum has\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"64\">  // the larger operand&#39;s exponent, the next one (a carry) or the one below (a borrow). Anything\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"65\">  // lower is a cancellation, which is exact, and so is a sum whose last place is finer than the\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"66\">  // smaller operand&#39;s.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"67\">  if (sumMagnitude == 0u || sumExponent + 1u &lt; largerExponent || sumExponent &gt; largerExponent + 1u ||\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"68\">      sumExponent &lt; smallerExponent) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"69\">    return 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"70\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"71\">  let sumShift = sumExponent - smallerExponent;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"72\">  let largerSignificand = (largerMagnitude &amp; 0x7fffffu) | select(0u, 0x800000u, largerMagnitude &gt;= 0x800000u);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"73\">  let smallerSignificand = (smallerMagnitude &amp; 0x7fffffu) | select(0u, 0x800000u, smallerMagnitude &gt;= 0x800000u);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"74\">  let sumSignificand = (sumMagnitude &amp; 0x7fffffu) | select(0u, 0x800000u, sumMagnitude &gt;= 0x800000u);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"75\">  // Signed integers in units of the smaller operand&#39;s last place, modulo 2^32. Each term can pass\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"76\">  // 2^32, but their combination is at most 2^25 in magnitude, so the wrapped result is exact.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"77\">  let largerUnits = largerSignificand &lt;&lt; gap;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"78\">  let sumUnits = sumSignificand &lt;&lt; sumShift;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"79\">  let signedLarger = select(largerUnits, 0u - largerUnits, (largerBits &amp; 0x80000000u) != 0u);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"80\">  let signedSmaller = select(smallerSignificand, 0u - smallerSignificand, (smallerBits &amp; 0x80000000u) != 0u);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"81\">  let signedSum = select(sumUnits, 0u - sumUnits, (sumBits &amp; 0x80000000u) != 0u);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"82\">  let errorUnits = bitcast&lt;i32&gt;(signedLarger + signedSmaller - signedSum);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"83\">  // The rounding error of an addition is an f32, so the conversion and the scaling are exact.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"84\">  return ldexp(f32(errorUnits), i32(smallerExponent) - 150);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"85\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"86\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"87\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"88\">fn getMultiplicationRoundingError(first: f32, second: f32, product: f32) -&gt; f32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"89\">  let firstBits = bitcast&lt;u32&gt;(first);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"90\">  let secondBits = bitcast&lt;u32&gt;(second);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"91\">  let productBits = bitcast&lt;u32&gt;(product);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"92\">  // Biased exponents: |value| = significand * 2^(exponent - 150) for a normal value.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"93\">  let firstExponent = (firstBits &gt;&gt; 23u) &amp; 0xffu;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"94\">  let secondExponent = (secondBits &gt;&gt; 23u) &amp; 0xffu;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"95\">  let productExponent = (productBits &gt;&gt; 23u) &amp; 0xffu;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"96\">  if (firstExponent == 0u || secondExponent == 0u || productExponent == 0u ||\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"97\">      firstExponent == 255u || secondExponent == 255u || productExponent == 255u) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"98\">    return 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"99\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"100\">  // The exact product is exactSignificand * 2^(firstExponent + secondExponent - 300), with a\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"101\">  // significand of 47 or 48 bits. The error is scaled by one ldexp whose exponent is kept at\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"102\">  // -126 or above, where ldexp is dependable: operands whose binary exponents sum to less than\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"103\">  // -80 report no error (every product below 2^-80, and those below 2^-79 whose significands\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"104\">  // multiply to 2 or more).\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"105\">  let exponentSum = firstExponent + secondExponent;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"106\">  if (exponentSum &lt; 174u) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"107\">    return 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"108\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"109\">  let firstSignificand = (firstBits &amp; 0x7fffffu) | 0x800000u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"110\">  let secondSignificand = (secondBits &amp; 0x7fffffu) | 0x800000u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"111\">  // 48-bit product of the two 24-bit significands, as two 24-bit limbs.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"112\">  let firstHigh = firstSignificand &gt;&gt; 12u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"113\">  let firstLow = firstSignificand &amp; 0xfffu;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"114\">  let secondHigh = secondSignificand &gt;&gt; 12u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"115\">  let secondLow = secondSignificand &amp; 0xfffu;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"116\">  let middle = firstHigh * secondLow + firstLow * secondHigh;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"117\">  let lowSum = firstLow * secondLow + ((middle &amp; 0xfffu) &lt;&lt; 12u);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"118\">  let exactLow = lowSum &amp; 0xffffffu;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"119\">  let exactHigh = firstHigh * secondHigh + (middle &gt;&gt; 12u) + (lowSum &gt;&gt; 24u);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"120\">  // The significand of the rounded product sits 23, 24 or 25 bits above the last place of the\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"121\">  // exact product (25 when the rounding carried into the next binade).\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"122\">  let shift = productExponent + 150u - exponentSum;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"123\">  if (shift &lt; 23u || shift &gt; 25u) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"124\">    return 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"125\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"126\">  let productSignificand = (productBits &amp; 0x7fffffu) | 0x800000u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"127\">  var roundedHigh = productSignificand;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"128\">  var roundedLow = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"129\">  if (shift == 23u) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"130\">    roundedHigh = productSignificand &gt;&gt; 1u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"131\">    roundedLow = (productSignificand &amp; 1u) &lt;&lt; 23u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"132\">  } else if (shift == 25u) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"133\">    roundedHigh = productSignificand &lt;&lt; 1u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"134\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"135\">  // Exact as an integer. Its conversion to f32 is exact for a correctly rounded product (at\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"136\">  // most 2^24 units); for a product one or two steps off it can need 25 bits and is rounded.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"137\">  let errorUnits = (i32(exactHigh) - i32(roundedHigh)) * 16777216 + (i32(exactLow) - i32(roundedLow));\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"138\">  let magnitude = ldexp(f32(errorUnits), i32(exponentSum) - 300);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"139\">  // The exact product has the sign of the operands&#39; signs combined; so has its error&#39;s scale.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"140\">  return select(magnitude, -magnitude, ((firstBits ^ secondBits) &amp; 0x80000000u) != 0u);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"141\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"142\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"143\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"144\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"145\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--workgroup-size\" data-line=\"146\">@compute @workgroup_size(64)\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--entry-point\" data-line=\"147\">fn main(\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"148\">  @builtin(local_invocation_index) localInvocationIndex: u32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"149\">  @builtin(workgroup_id) workgroupId: vec3&lt;u32&gt;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"150\">) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"151\">  _ = &amp;attributes;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"152\">  _ = &amp;validity;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"153\">  _ = INVOCATION_COUNT;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"154\">  let workgroupIndex =\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"155\">    (workgroupId.z * WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_Y + workgroupId.y) * WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_X +\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"156\">    workgroupId.x;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"157\">  if (workgroupIndex &gt;= 67108864u) { return; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"158\">  let index = workgroupIndex * 64u + localInvocationIndex;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"159\">  if (index &gt;= INVOCATION_COUNT) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"160\">    return;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"161\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"162\">  var isValid = true;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"163\">  \n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"164\">  for (var channel = 0u; channel &lt; ATTRIBUTE_COUNT; channel++) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"165\">    isValid = isValid &amp;&amp; isFiniteValue(attributes[attributesOffset + index * ATTRIBUTE_COUNT + channel]);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"166\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"167\">  validity[validityOffset + index] = select(0u, 1u, isValid);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"168\">}\n</span></code></pre><table><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Resource</th><th>Access</th><th>Element type</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>attributes<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"values\">values</td><td>read</td><td>f32</td></tr><tr><td>validity<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"similar-locations-validity\">similar-locations-validity</td><td>read_write</td><td>u32</td></tr></tbody></table><figcaption>GPUSimilarLocations/validate · main · 996dfbf0</figcaption></figure></section>",
